# Build context for frontend/Dockerfile. P4.S1.
#
# Docker honours ONLY full-line `#` comments — a `#` after a pattern becomes part
# of the pattern and silently stops it matching.

# node_modules: mac-native binaries would poison the linux image, and the build
# stage runs its own `npm ci` from package-lock.json anyway.
node_modules
# .next: a stale mac build output, including a stale standalone tree.
.next
*.tsbuildinfo
# No env file ever enters this context. The one value the build needs
# (MIJUAL_API_ORIGIN) arrives as a build ARG from compose.prod.yml.
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
